        "created_at": "2013-06-05T16:25:53.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Alright, folks. Since there's an audience here, I wanted to mention a new game design from yours truly. The idea is that I wanted the 4X experience (a la Space Empires 4X, Twilight Imperium, Eclipse) in a more casual form. Nothing like that existed, really, so I made my own. The rules are done, but not copy edited or playtested. I have a hand-done prototype, also. If anyone is interested in taking a look, drop me a line. Thanks!</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:38:36.919Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
