        "raw": "<p>Alright, folks. Since there&#39;s an audience here, I wanted to mention a new game design from yours truly. The idea is that I wanted the 4X experience (a la Space Empires 4X, Twilight Imperium, Eclipse) in a more casual form. Nothing like that existed, really, so I made my own. The rules are done, but not copy edited or playtested. I have a hand-done prototype, also. If anyone is interested in taking a look, drop me a line. Thanks!</p>",
